---
import SectionSubtitle from '../../global/SectionSubtitle.astro';
---

<section class="section_process">
  <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-fluid w-container">
    <div class="process-wrapper-v2">
      <div class="process-content-wrapper">
        <div class="process-container">
          <div class="process-header-wrap">
            <div page-scroll-1="" class="section-subtitle-block">
              <SectionSubtitle text="Our Process" variant="v2" />
            </div>
            <h2 heading-style-2="" class="heading-style-h1 text-color-white">The Principles That Guide Everything We Do</h2>
          </div>
          <div page-scroll-2="" class="process-summary-wrap">
            <p class="process-summary">Every successful project follows a structured workflow designed to minimize risks, maximize efficiency, and deliver measurable results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-card-wrapper">
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Discover</h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//01</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">We begin by deeply understanding your business, target audience, goals, and challenges to identify valuable opportunities for meaningful and sustainable growth.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">01</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-1.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Define </h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//02</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">We begin by deeply understanding your business, target audience, goals, and challenges to identify valuable opportunities for meaningful and sustainable growth.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">02</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-2.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-2.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Experience</h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//03</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">We design intuitive user experiences and visually captivating interfaces that truly embody your brand identity and connect effectively with your audience.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">03</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-3.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-3.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Develop</h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//04</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">Our skilled team transforms approved concepts into fast, responsive, and scalable digital products engineered for long-term success and adaptability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">04</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-4.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-4-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-4.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Test &amp; Launch</h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//05</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">Prior to launch, we meticulously test every aspect to guarantee optimal performance, usability, and reliability across all devices and platforms.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">05</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-5.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-5-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-5.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-single-card-block">
          <div class="process-content-block">
            <div class="process-card-title-block">
              <h3 class="process-card-title">Grow</h3>
              <div class="process-card-number">//06</div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-summary-block">
              <p class="process-card-text">Following launch, we continuously monitor, refine, and enhance your digital presence to maximize results and foster ongoing growth and engagement.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card-bottom">
            <div class="process-card-number-bold">06</div>
            <div class="process-card-image-block"><img src="/images/Process-Image-6.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Process-Image-6-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Process-Image-6.webp 568w" alt="process-card-image" class="process-card-image"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
